# Customer Churn Prediction

A machine learning classification project for predicting whether a telecom customer is likely to churn based on customer account, service, and billing information.

The project covers the machine learning workflow from data exploration and preprocessing to model comparison, cross-validation, hyperparameter tuning, model interpretation, and deployment using Streamlit.

