## 🤖 Models Evaluated

Four classification algorithms were evaluated:

- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree
- Random Forest
- Gradient Boosting

---

## 📈 Initial Model Results

| Model | Accuracy | Precision | Recall | F1 Score | ROC-AUC |
|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|
| Logistic Regression | 80.4% | 64.8% | 57.2% | 60.8% | 83.6% |
| Decision Tree | 73.6% | 50.3% | 51.1% | 50.7% | 66.3% |
| Random Forest | 78.3% | 61.9% | 47.9% | 54.0% | 81.3% |
| Gradient Boosting | 79.7% | 64.3% | 52.9% | 58.1% | 83.9% |

---

## 🌳 Decision Tree Overfitting

The Decision Tree achieved approximately:

```text
Training Accuracy: 99.9%
Testing Accuracy: 73.6%
```

The tree also reached:

```text
Tree Depth: 24
Number of Leaves: 1109
```

The large difference between training and testing accuracy indicated strong overfitting.

---

## 🌲 Random Forest Results

The Random Forest achieved approximately:

```text
Training Accuracy: 99.9%
Testing Accuracy: 78.3%
```

Although it performed better than the single Decision Tree, it still showed a large difference between training and testing performance.

---

## 🚀 Gradient Boosting Results

Gradient Boosting achieved approximately:

```text
Training Accuracy: 83.0%
Testing Accuracy: 79.7%
```

The smaller difference between training and testing accuracy suggested better generalization compared with the Decision Tree and Random Forest models.

---

## 🔁 Cross-Validation

Five-fold stratified cross-validation was performed on the strongest models.

### Logistic Regression

Mean ROC-AUC:

```text
0.846
```

### Gradient Boosting

Mean ROC-AUC:

```text
0.847
```

Both models showed consistent performance across the validation folds.

---

## 🔧 Hyperparameter Tuning

`GridSearchCV` was used to search for improved model configurations.

### Gradient Boosting

Best parameters:

```text
learning_rate = 0.1
max_depth = 2
n_estimators = 100
```

Best cross-validation ROC-AUC:

```text
0.849
```

### Logistic Regression

Best parameters:

```text
C = 10
class_weight = None
```

Best cross-validation ROC-AUC:

```text
0.846
```

